<title>NETHERLANDS: STORK TO SELL UNIT TO BW/IP.</title>
<headline>STORK TO SELL UNIT TO BW/IP.</headline>
<dateline>NAARDEN, Netherlands 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial systems and services group Stork NV said on Friday it expects to reach agreement on selling the engineered pump activities of its unit Stork Pompen to BW/IP International BV.</p>
<p>No financial details of the intended transaction were disclosed. Stork said the unit employed about 100 people.</p>
<p>The deal would strenghten BW/IP's position in the market of engineered pumps for the petrochemical industry and large scale marine projects, it added.</p>
<p>BW/IP International BV is part of BW/IP Inc. of the U.S.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
